  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Information :</strong> <a style=\"color: #ff0000;\" href=\"https://www.sarkariexam.com/rrb-junior-engineer-je-2025/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Railway Recruitment Board (RRB)</a></span> has released the CBT II Answer Key &nbsp;for the Junior Engineer JE, CMA &amp; DMS Posts on the official website of RRB. This recruitment was released for 2585 posts. Applications for the RRB Junior Engineer JE Recruitment 2025 were accepted from 31 October 2025, to 10 December 2025. The CBT II examination was conducted on 02 July 2026. Candidates who qualified in the CBT I examination can download their Railway RRB Junior Engineer CBT II Answer Key 2026 from the link provided below.</span></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Railway Recruitment Board (RRB)</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">Railway RRB JE CEN.No: 05/2025 CBT II Answer Key 2026</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">RRB JE Advt No. : CEN 05/2025&nbsp;</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates&nbsp;</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Starting Date :&nbsp;<strong>31 October 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Last Date for Apply :<strong> 10 December 2025 (Extended)</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Last Date Fee Payment :<strong> 12 December 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Form Correction / Modified Date :<strong> 13-22 December 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Application Status : <strong>12 January 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"background-color: #ffffff; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Exam Date :<strong> 19, 20 February 2026 &amp; 03 March 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Exam City Details : <strong>10 February 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Admit Card : <strong>16 February 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">CBT-I Answer Key :<strong> 05 March 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">CBT-I Result :<strong> 13 May 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">CBT-II Exam Date :<strong> 02 July 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">CBT-II Exam City Details : <strong>22 June 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Answer Key : <strong>10 July 2026</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Application Fee</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">General, OBC, EWS :&nbsp;<strong>Rs. 500/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">SC, ST, PH :&nbsp;<strong>Rs. 250/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">All Category Female :<strong>&nbsp;Rs. 250/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: #ffff00; color: #000000;\"><strong>Fee Refund (After Appearing in Stage I Exam)</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">General, OBC, EWS, :&nbsp;<strong>Rs. 400/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">SC, ST, PH : <strong>Rs. 250/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">All Category Female :<strong>&nbsp;Rs. 250/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates have to pay their Examination Fee Through Debit Card / Credit Card / Net Banking / UPI and Other Fee Payment Mode Only.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">[adinserter block=”3″]</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>RRB Junior Engineer JE Notification 2025 : Age Limit</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Age Limit As On 01 January 2026</span></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Minimum Age :&nbsp;<strong>18 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Maximum Age :&nbsp;<strong>33 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Age Relaxation as per RRB Junior Engineer JE Recruitment Rules.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Use <span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #ffff00;\"> </span>Tool – </span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>RRB Junior Engineer JE 2025 : Vacancy Details</strong></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Total Posts : 2585 Posts</strong></span></p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 47.2487%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 26.785%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Category</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 25.9662%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>No. of Posts</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 47.2487%; text-align: center;\" rowspan=\"5\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Junior Engineer JE</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 26.785%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">General&nbsp;</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 25.9662%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">1096</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 26.785%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">EWS</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 25.9662%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">246</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 26.785%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">OBC</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 25.9662%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">620</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 26.785%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">SC</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 25.9662%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">411</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 26.785%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">ST</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 25.9662%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">212</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 47.2487%; text-align: center;\" colspan=\"3\"><span style=\"background-color: #ffcc00; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Check</strong>&nbsp;<strong>RRB Zone Wise Vacancy Details –&nbsp;<a style=\"background-color: #ffcc00;\" href=\"https://www.sarkariexam.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/04_14_24pm142384bf87cab8ba2918a287b376265c-38-60.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Click Here</a></strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>RRB Junior Engineer JE Recruitment 2025 : Educational Qualification</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates who have Engineering Diploma / B.Sc Degree, specific qualifications for JE (IT) and Chemical &amp; Metallurgical Assistant will be eligible for this recruitment.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"background-color: #ffcc00; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Check Post Wise Eligibility Details : <a href=\"https://www.sarkariexam.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/04_14_24pm142384bf87cab8ba2918a287b376265c-1-33-36.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Click Here</a></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">For More Experience / Knowledge, Candidates are advised to must read the official notification before applying for the above mentioned posts</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">All candidates must read the official information completely before applying.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>RRB Junior Engineer JE Online Form 2025 : </strong></span><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Mode of Selection</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">CBT Exam</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Typing Test (If Applicable)</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Document Verification</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Medical Examination</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>How To Download Railway RRB Junior Engineer CEN.No: 05/2025 CBT II Answer Key 2026</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Candidates must go to the&nbsp;<strong>Important Links</strong>&nbsp;section below</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Then the candidates must click on the&nbsp;<strong>Download Answer Key</strong>&nbsp;link.&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">After clicking on the link, the candidates will be redirected to a new page.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">In this page, candidates have to enter the following details:</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Registration no.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Login ID</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Birth Date/Password</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Captcha Code</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Then the candidates have to&nbsp; submit the details by clicking on the Login button.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">After successful login, candidates will be able to download the Answer Key.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Alternatively, the candidates can download the RRB JE Answer Key from the official website of RRB also.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" style=\"width: 100.27%;\" colspan=\"7\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Check Zone Wise RRB Junior Engineer CEN.No: 05/2025 CBT I Result 2026</strong></span></h3>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><span st